  "description": "The first love who disappeared 14 years ago reappears before him! Jae-Hyuk, who lost his close friends Jun-Young and Chun-Ha in a gruesome unsolved murder during his high school days, cannot forget that day and becomes a police officer. As time passes and the statute of limitations expires, Jae-Hyuk is able to reinvestigate the case. He returns to his hometown after 14 years, but much has changed. But then, Chun-Ha, his first love who vanished 14 years ago, reappears before Jae-Hyuk...!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
